    "columns": 1,
    "content": "<p>AI researcher and software engineer with Tsinghua University graduate training, U.S. master's and Ph.D. research, and 10+ years spanning biomedical AI, graph learning, computer vision, LLM applications, HPC, and enterprise systems. Combines interdisciplinary healthcare research with production software engineering, multi-institution collaboration, and hands-on Python and PyTorch development.</p>",
