          "description": "<ul><li>Developed EMMA, an LLM-based assistant for postpartum-depression support using LLaMA/ChatGPT, RAG, PEFT, Milvus, Neo4j, Flowise, Gradio, and Streamlit to connect users with locally relevant resources</li><li>Applied Random Forest, XGBoost, and SVM to ambulatory-visit and public-health data, identifying blood-pressure and A1C monitoring gaps and supporting hypertension-prediction research</li><li>Designed AI and data workflows spanning EHR, environmental sensors, and public-health repositories; contributed manuscripts, grant proposals, technical documentation, and cross-disciplinary research supervision</li></ul>",
